{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36687","headline":"早春送张坤归大梁 · 罗隐","name":"早春送张坤归大梁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧羸马正尘埃，又送輶轩向吹台。\n别酒莫辞今夜醉，故人知是几时回。\n泉经华岳犹应冻，花到梁园始合开。\n爲谢东门抱关吏，不堪惆怅满离杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}